  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/49762b49269a3fb09105522469e0ed6e17e102a8cf136bf2ccda0786fd3ea3ff.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tGọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>P</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra\n\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường trung bình nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>